new_text:
{"text": "I brought my nine-year-old child to the hospital this afternoon. I sent the child on an errand to buy something for me in town, but a dog bit the child. When they brought the child home and explained what happened, I examined the wound where the dog bit the child, and I noticed that the wound is red and already swollen. We made inquiries in the neighborhood to find out about the dog that bit the child, and the dog's owner said that they have never given the dog any vaccines. They mentioned that it just goes out, plays, and comes back inside. They said they have never given the dog any medical treatment whatsoever. This is why I became frightened and rushed the child to the hospital, so that it wouldn't turn out that the dog that bit the child is a rabid dog. What could possibly happen to a child who has been bitten by a dog? What could happen to a wound that is red and swollen? Is it possible for an infection like rabies to enter this wound? Is it possible for something terrible to happen to the child as a result of this dog bite? Please...
What can I do to prevent an infection from entering this wound? What vaccines and what medications can be used to treat this child to ensure they receive proper care? What else can we do, or what medical tests can we run to care for the wound where the dog bit this child?

", "text_language": "English", "translated_text": "Na kawo yarona mai shekaru tara ashibiti yau da rana. Na aiki yaron ya sayi wani abu a gari, amma kare ya ciji yaron. Lokacin da suka dawo da yaron gida kuma suka bayyana abin da ya faru, na bincika wurin da karen ya ciji yaron, sai na lura cewa wurin yayi ja kuma ya riga ya kumbura. Mun yi bincike a unguwa don jin labarin karen da ya ciji yaron sai mai karen ya ce ba su taba ba wa karen kowane irin alluran rigakafi ba. Suka ce kawai yana fita ne, ya yi wasa, ya dawo gida. Suka ce ba su taba ba wa karen kowace irin jiyya ta likitanci ba kwata-kwata. Wannan ya sa na shiga tsoro na rugo da yaron asibiti, domin kada ya kasance karen da ya ciji yaron mahaukacin kare ne. Mene ne zai iya faruwa ga yaron da kare ya ciji shi? Mene ne zai iya faruwa ga ciwon da yake da ja da kumburi? Shin zai iya yiwuwa cuta mai yaduwa kamar hauka ta shiga cikin wannan ciwon? Shin zai iya yiwuwa wani abu mai ban tsoro ya faru ga yaron sakamakon wannan cizon kare? Don Allah..Mene ne zan iya yi don hana cuta shiga cikin wannan ciwon? Wadanne alluran rigakafi da wadanne magunguna ne za a iya amfani da su wajen yi wa wannan yaro jiyya don tabbatar da sun sami kulawa ta gari? Mene ne daban za mu iya yi, ko wadanne gwaje-gwajen likitanci za mu iya gudanarwa don kula da ciwon da karen ya ciji wannan yaro", "translated_text_language": "Hausa", "audio_language": "Hausa", "text_was_edited": false}
